<title>USA: CCC buys 15,180 T wheat, 16,080 T corn for Angola.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 15,180 T wheat, 16,080 T corn for Angola.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it purchased 16,080 tonnes of yellow corn and 15,180 tonnes of hard red winter wheat for export to Angola.</p>
<p>The grain was purchased from Continental Grain, with the wheat priced at $176.89 and the corn at $129.39 a tonne, both FOB Beaumont. Delivery is slated for April 1-25.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
